      "value": "Apologies, no example avatar is needed - I'd missed that your report is specifically against the SDK.\n\nThere's a known SDK-only issue where a VRChat constraint that has a physbone as a child object will not run until you enter play mode in the editor. This happens regardless of whether or not Is Animated is enabled on the physbone. Is this the specific issue you're seeing when you say the constraint does not work properly?",
